      "content": "I just looked at the month-over-month numbers for the last two quarters and it looks a bit flat to me... like the acquisition rate isn't really climbing like it used to. \n\nBut I know they mentioned they were pivoting their strategy recently to focus on retention over raw user acquisition. If you look at the details, do you see the growth curve sustaining itself, or is that \"exponential\" claim just marketing fluff?",
